{
  "source": "VoiceCommand-WebServer/assets/ToolsPrompt.txt (44 tools incl. DefaultResponse, Alpha..Zulu). Third blind held-out set: written from the tool contract only; eval_cases.json, heldout_cases.json and heldout2_cases.json were consulted for schema and de-duplication only. No access to the training data, its generator, or any benchmark results.",
  "grading": "function name exact; arguments exact after: filterNames split on ',' and compared as a set; DefaultResponse graded on function name only (text is the raw input, the app can fill it).",
  "suites": {
    "field": "Radio-style operator speech in a running wargame: clipped and impatient, situational lead-ins (적 진지 보인다, 배터리 다 됐다, 화면 기울었어 ...), plain/polite mix (해 / 해라 / 주세요 / 합니다 / 주십시오), Korean number words in every numeric slot (native 두·세·넷·여섯·열, Sino 일·이·삼·사·오·육·칠·팔·구·십 with 대/기/호기/번), 18 non-Alpha callsigns, drone commands with and without a team. Every non-default tool at least once.",
    "asr": "The same kind of commands as a speech recogniser might emit them: spaces inserted inside words (쓰 루, 카메 라창, 승 인) or deleted between words (전장의안개, 제어권반납), dropped particles, and the contract's documented mis-transcriptions (제억원·제역원·제혁원·제어건, 이항, 횟수, 줄리에·줄리의, 프리새, 제추천, 기환·기완, 복구, 게시, 새틴, 이오기·사모기·사오기, 유지비, 이 번 프리셋, 다다·달아, 지어, 거). Only cases whose intent stays certain.",
    "reject": "Must be DefaultResponse: negated commands, questions about current state, unsupported look-alikes (zoom, formation, altitude, speed, map scale, target designation, pause, deselect, unknown window/filter), two actions in one sentence, missing drone/preset number or team, invalid callsigns, two teams at once, deprecated distance move, chit-chat.",
    "contrast": "Minimal pairs and triads across confusable tools: drone camera vs drone view, team vs drone return, team camera vs team view vs team overview, recommendation-window close vs filter-window close vs confirm reject/accept (전술 확정 취소, 편집 취소 승인), marker move vs create vs marker filter, filter window vs filter vs video-through, the four control verbs on one team, open vs close of the same window with 켜/꺼 (filter verbs) instead of 열어/닫아."
  },
